=\"lex-cite-author\">Men.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">484</span> </span>, acc. <span class=\"gk\">γυνάς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Com.Adesp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1336</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">EM</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">243.24</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">AB</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">86</span> </span>:—<b class=\"lex-tr\">woman,</b> opp.<b class=\"lex-tr\">man,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">15.683</span> </span>, etc.: with a second <span class=\"lex-gram\">Subst.</span>, <span class=\"gk\">γ. ταμίη</span> housekeeper, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.390</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δέσποινα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.347</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">γρηΰς</span> (q. v.), <span class=\"gk\">ἀλετρίς</span> (q. v.), <span class=\"gk\">δμῳαὶ γυναῖκες</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.477</span> </span>,al.; <span class=\"gk\">Περσίδες γ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.3</span> </span>: voc., as a term of respect or affection, <b class=\"lex-tr\">mistress, lady,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Med.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">290</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Theoc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">15.12</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">φαντὶ γυναῖκες</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">the lasses</b> say, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20.30</span> </